      "author": "item",
      "content": "It's difficult to understand how this actually did result in a finished movie. It has no character at all on almost any level, in terms of story or cinematography. If you'd see any experimental take they tried to play with and didn't succeed, I'd appreciate that, but you can't sense any. \r\nThis is no rant, I just think it's a very miserable take on any topic and concept which they try to make part of their story.",
